{"id":4984,"date":"2025-08-07T12:01:55","date_gmt":"2025-08-07T12:01:55","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4984"},"modified":"2025-08-28T12:55:58","modified_gmt":"2025-08-28T05:55:58","slug":"hashtag-tiktok-tong-hop-hashtag-dang-trend","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/kien-thuc-tiktok\/hashtag-tiktok-tong-hop-hashtag-dang-trend\/","title":{"rendered":"Hashtag TikTok: T\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p hashtag \u0111ang trend, t\u0103ng view"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"MPGLdyQWgol5zNxjkTPlFwNlggg\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B28xdpTMNoiVV4x90WglmnHLgde\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">B\u1ea1n \u0111ang t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm c\u00e1c hashtag \u0111ang trend, viral v\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh? Hashtag TikTok l\u00e0 ch\u00eca kh\u00f3a gi\u00fap video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i \u0111\u00fang t\u1ec7p ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem, gia t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng l\u00ean xu h\u01b0\u1edbng. D\u00f9 b\u1ea1n l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung hay kinh doanh tr\u00ean TikTok, vi\u1ec7c ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u00fang hashtag s\u1ebd gi\u00fap t\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u00e0 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u r\u00f5 r\u1ec7t. C\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\">Lemon Digital<\/span><\/strong><\/a> kh\u00e1m ph\u00e1 ngay b\u1ed9 hashtag t\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p m\u1edbi nh\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u l\u01b0\u1ee3t view v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 tr\u00ean TikTok!<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S7umdeXzxodht5xdjlqlLrQ7gqe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-F0aidyIA3oMeYSx8VNRlVJI0gfh\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1. Hashtag TikTok l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/strong><\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5034\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5034\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5034\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Ket-hop-hashtag-trending-va-niche-\u2013-Su-dung-3\u20135-hashta.png\" alt=\"TikTok s\u1ebd d\u1ef1a v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3 \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 n\u1ed9i dung, ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i video cho nh\u00f3m ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng quan t\u00e2m \u0111\u1ebfn ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 \u0111\u00f3\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Ket-hop-hashtag-trending-va-niche-\u2013-Su-dung-3\u20135-hashta.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Ket-hop-hashtag-trending-va-niche-\u2013-Su-dung-3\u20135-hashta-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Ket-hop-hashtag-trending-va-niche-\u2013-Su-dung-3\u20135-hashta-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Ket-hop-hashtag-trending-va-niche-\u2013-Su-dung-3\u20135-hashta-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Ket-hop-hashtag-trending-va-niche-\u2013-Su-dung-3\u20135-hashta-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5034\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">TikTok s\u1ebd d\u1ef1a v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3 \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 n\u1ed9i dung, ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i video cho nh\u00f3m ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng quan t\u00e2m \u0111\u1ebfn ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 \u0111\u00f3<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AbzAdOeuAoku4zx9ay8lG1IMgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hashtag TikTok l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng t\u1eeb ho\u1eb7c c\u1ee5m t\u1eeb \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c vi\u1ebft li\u1ec1n nhau v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb7t sau d\u1ea5u \u201c#\u201d, \u0111\u00f3ng vai tr\u00f2 nh\u01b0 m\u1ed9t nh\u00e3n d\u00e1n n\u1ed9i dung gi\u00fap ph\u00e2n lo\u1ea1i, t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i video tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 r\u1ea5t quan tr\u1ecdng trong thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a TikTok, gi\u00fap video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n d\u1ec5 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng v\u00e0 gia t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c lan truy\u1ec1n (viral).<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PK1Td5OzxohpWaxPNYZlv72Og1g\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi b\u1ea1n g\u1eafn hashtag v\u00e0o ph\u1ea7n m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 video, TikTok s\u1ebd d\u1ef1a v\u00e0o \u0111\u00f3 \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 n\u1ed9i dung, ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i video cho nh\u00f3m ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng quan t\u00e2m \u0111\u1ebfn ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 \u0111\u00f3, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi gi\u00fap video xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n trong c\u00e1c k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u1ee9ng. V\u00ed d\u1ee5: ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng quan t\u00e2m \u0111\u1ebfn ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 du l\u1ecbch c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm b\u1eb1ng t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a <code>#travel<\/code>, c\u00f2n ng\u01b0\u1eddi y\u00eau l\u00e0m \u0111\u1eb9p s\u1ebd t\u00ecm \u0111\u1ebfn <code>#makeuptips<\/code>, <code>#skincare<\/code>. Ngo\u00e0i ra, hashtag c\u00f2n gi\u00fap video tham gia v\u00e0o c\u00e1c trend \u0111ang hot, th\u1eed th\u00e1ch c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng, ho\u1eb7c x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n\/doanh nghi\u1ec7p.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AkFIdS7avoTud2x5hTilP9bYgNd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-MphkdG1PaocxyyxEo9tlq31MgKc\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>2. V\u00ec sao n\u00ean s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng hashtag Tiktok l\u00ean xu h\u01b0\u1edbng?<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQvjddGfaov6hjx3fIdlylqOgzg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng hashtag kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00e2n lo\u1ea1i video, m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 gi\u00fap n\u1ed9i dung c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang ng\u01b0\u1eddi v\u00e0 c\u00f3 c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i l\u00ean xu h\u01b0\u1edbng (viral). D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 3 l\u00fd do quan tr\u1ecdng l\u00fd gi\u1ea3i v\u00ec sao hashtag l\u1ea1i \u0111\u00f3ng vai tr\u00f2 l\u1edbn trong th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t video TikTok:<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-ZYfLdbiOaoFFMaxGoAWlMLi5gjF\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>T\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb tr\u00ean \u201cFor You\u201d\u00a0<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RntJdJlAVoux3KxmLdblCKCbgxc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t n\u1ed9i dung, v\u00e0 hashtag l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t trong nh\u1eefng t\u00edn hi\u1ec7u quan tr\u1ecdng gi\u00fap h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng hi\u1ec3u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c n\u1ed9i dung b\u1ea1n \u0111ang chia s\u1ebb. Khi video c\u00f3 hashtag ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p, thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n s\u1ebd d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i video \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u00fang nh\u00f3m ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng \u0111ang quan t\u00e2m, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 t\u0103ng c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n tr\u00ean trang \u201cFor You\u201d (FYP) \u2014 n\u01a1i t\u1ea1o ra ph\u1ea7n l\u1edbn l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem cho h\u1ea7u h\u1ebft video.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5036\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5036\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5036\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Tang-kha-nang-hien-thi-tren-For-You-\u2013-Thuat-toan-TikTok.png\" alt=\"Thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n TikTok \u01b0u ti\u00ean n\u1ed9i dung c\u00f3 hashtag ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Tang-kha-nang-hien-thi-tren-For-You-\u2013-Thuat-toan-TikTok.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Tang-kha-nang-hien-thi-tren-For-You-\u2013-Thuat-toan-TikTok-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Tang-kha-nang-hien-thi-tren-For-You-\u2013-Thuat-toan-TikTok-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Tang-kha-nang-hien-thi-tren-For-You-\u2013-Thuat-toan-TikTok-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Tang-kha-nang-hien-thi-tren-For-You-\u2013-Thuat-toan-TikTok-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5036\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n TikTok \u01b0u ti\u00ean n\u1ed9i dung c\u00f3 hashtag ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-RHWtdcvSNo5tlbxVaIYlILaXg1o\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang nh\u00f3m kh\u00e1n gi\u1ea3 m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y08Pd3MtKoQJMfxegqllFmgBgBd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Thay v\u00ec lan truy\u1ec1n ng\u1eabu nhi\u00ean, vi\u1ec7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng hashtag \u0111\u00fang ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 s\u1ebd gi\u00fap video h\u01b0\u1edbng t\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1n gi\u1ea3 th\u1ef1c s\u1ef1 quan t\u00e2m. V\u00ed d\u1ee5: n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n l\u00e0m video v\u1ec1 m\u1eb9o l\u00e0m \u0111\u1eb9p, hashtag nh\u01b0 <code>#beautyhacks<\/code> ho\u1eb7c <code>#skincare101<\/code> s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nh\u1eefng ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng y\u00eau th\u00edch l\u00e0m \u0111\u1eb9p. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem m\u00e0 c\u00f2n n\u00e2ng cao ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c (b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn, chia s\u1ebb, theo d\u00f5i\u2026).<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5040\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5040\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5040\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Tiep-can-dung-nhom-khan-gia-muc-tieu-\u2013-Gan-hashtag.png\" alt=\"G\u1eafn hashtag ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p gi\u00fap video \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi quan t\u00e2m\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Tiep-can-dung-nhom-khan-gia-muc-tieu-\u2013-Gan-hashtag.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Tiep-can-dung-nhom-khan-gia-muc-tieu-\u2013-Gan-hashtag-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Tiep-can-dung-nhom-khan-gia-muc-tieu-\u2013-Gan-hashtag-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Tiep-can-dung-nhom-khan-gia-muc-tieu-\u2013-Gan-hashtag-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Tiep-can-dung-nhom-khan-gia-muc-tieu-\u2013-Gan-hashtag-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5040\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">G\u1eafn hashtag ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p gi\u00fap video \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi quan t\u00e2m<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-DmandO4o0o7ZQqx3ziGlf8pYgnf\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>X\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u &amp; c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng\u00a0<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TG1CdgD2XoFULdxPuIXlC0IGg9b\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ngo\u00e0i vi\u1ec7c t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c hashtag ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn, b\u1ea1n c\u0169ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o hashtag mang t\u00ednh c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ri\u00eang nh\u01b0 <code>#YourBrandName<\/code> ho\u1eb7c <code>#TeamTenTen<\/code>. Khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u1eb7n, nh\u1eefng hashtag n\u00e0y s\u1ebd gi\u00fap kh\u00e1n gi\u1ea3 ghi nh\u1edb th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, t\u1ea1o th\u00e0nh c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng n\u1ed9i dung nh\u1ea5t qu\u00e1n v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 lan truy\u1ec1n h\u01a1n trong d\u00e0i h\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5041\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5041\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5041\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Xay-dung-thuong-hieu-cong-dong-\u2013-Hashtag-thu.png\" alt=\"Hashtag th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u gi\u00fap t\u1ea1o d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n v\u00e0 lan t\u1ecfa n\u1ed9i dung\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Xay-dung-thuong-hieu-cong-dong-\u2013-Hashtag-thu.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Xay-dung-thuong-hieu-cong-dong-\u2013-Hashtag-thu-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Xay-dung-thuong-hieu-cong-dong-\u2013-Hashtag-thu-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Xay-dung-thuong-hieu-cong-dong-\u2013-Hashtag-thu-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Xay-dung-thuong-hieu-cong-dong-\u2013-Hashtag-thu-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5041\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Hashtag th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u gi\u00fap t\u1ea1o d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n v\u00e0 lan t\u1ecfa n\u1ed9i dung<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hkkvd3DKnoBY2mxPBfLl9n4AgHk\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-JlBWd5VSCo8qIvx5fVklHhHOgyc\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>3. C\u00e1ch d\u00f9ng hashtag TikTok hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LycTdrKIRoTzMAxPzUhlDeILgke\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn, thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n TikTok kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 d\u1ef1a v\u00e0o n\u1ed9i dung video m\u00e0 c\u00f2n \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 ph\u1ea7n caption v\u00e0 h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng hashtag \u0111i k\u00e8m.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-JOB2dhdpYoAbfIxdQ0rlb2Djgqg\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p hashtag trending v\u00e0 niche\u00a0<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NcRldmR5CoblYuxuY5NlLEs1gah\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">TikTok \u01b0u ti\u00ean ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i nh\u1eefng video c\u00f3 n\u1ed9i dung r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 li\u00ean quan cao, v\u00ec v\u1eady vi\u1ec7c l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn v\u00e0 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p hashtag h\u1ee3p l\u00fd l\u00e0 y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 r\u1ea5t quan tr\u1ecdng. C\u1ee5 th\u1ec3, b\u1ea1n n\u00ean s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng 1\u20132 hashtag trending nh\u01b0 <code>#viral<\/code>, <code>#fyp<\/code>, <code>#TikTokTrend<\/code> \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng s\u1ee9c lan t\u1ecfa hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i, k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p th\u00eam 2\u20133 hashtag theo ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 (niche) nh\u01b0 <code>#reviewdoan<\/code>, <code>#makeuptips<\/code>, ho\u1eb7c <code>#codinglife<\/code> \u0111\u1ec3 h\u01b0\u1edbng n\u1ed9i dung \u0111\u1ebfn \u0111\u00fang nh\u00f3m \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QOm5dhNF8ojuZaxhLOJlB7zegHh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo s\u1ed1 li\u1ec7u t\u1eeb Later (2024), video s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng 3\u20135 hashtag c\u00f3 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t l\u00ean trang \u201cFor You\u201d (FYP) cao h\u01a1n 40% so v\u1edbi video kh\u00f4ng g\u1eafn hashtag. Ngo\u00e0i ra, c\u00e1c video c\u00f3 t\u1ed5ng \u0111\u1ed9 d\u00e0i hashtag t\u1eeb 21\u201335 k\u00fd t\u1ef1 th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n TikTok qu\u00e9t v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 h\u01a1n so v\u1edbi c\u00e1c video c\u00f3 hashtag qu\u00e1 ng\u1eafn ho\u1eb7c qu\u00e1 d\u00e0i.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5033\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5033\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5033\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Hashtag-TikTok.png\" alt=\"S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng 3\u20135 hashtag mix gi\u1eefa xu h\u01b0\u1edbng v\u00e0 l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c n\u1ed9i dung\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Hashtag-TikTok.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Hashtag-TikTok-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Hashtag-TikTok-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Hashtag-TikTok-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Hashtag-TikTok-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5033\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng 3\u20135 hashtag mix gi\u1eefa xu h\u01b0\u1edbng v\u00e0 l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c n\u1ed9i dung<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-EhtUdReB1o1DLoxGiQIlDZWIgKf\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>C\u00e1 nh\u00e2n h\u00f3a hashtag th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u\u00a0<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R97HdUHt4osnhyxJzx2lN7c0gIg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u1ea1o v\u00e0 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng hashtag \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n nh\u01b0 <code>#ShopCuaToi<\/code>, <code>#TeamTrangMakeup<\/code> l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng chu\u1ed7i n\u1ed9i dung mang d\u1ea5u \u1ea5n ri\u00eang, \u0111\u1ed3ng th\u1eddi gi\u00fap th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ho\u1eb7c c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t v\u00e0 \u0111o l\u01b0\u1eddng m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 lan t\u1ecfa c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RRxOdIrmookTQsxd7avlNRa4gxg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">L\u1ee3i \u00edch ch\u00ednh c\u1ee7a vi\u1ec7c c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n h\u00f3a hashtag bao g\u1ed3m vi\u1ec7c t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, v\u00ec ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o hashtag \u0111\u1ec3 xem to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 n\u1ed9i dung li\u00ean quan \u0111\u1ebfn m\u1ed9t th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c series n\u1ed9i dung. Nh\u1eb1m th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng viral, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t khi ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng l\u1ea1i ch\u00ednh hashtag \u0111\u00f3 trong c\u00e1c video t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c ho\u1eb7c tham gia chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WrW0dTplnobh56xqWkPlCO1ogtI\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">V\u00ed d\u1ee5 th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf: Hashtag <code>#GUforTikTok<\/code> do th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u th\u1eddi trang GU (Nh\u1eadt B\u1ea3n) tri\u1ec3n khai \u0111\u00e3 thu h\u00fat h\u01a1n 200 tri\u1ec7u l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem ch\u1ec9 trong v\u00f2ng 2 tu\u1ea7n, cho th\u1ea5y hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i khi k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u1eefa n\u1ed9i dung s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o v\u00e0 hashtag th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u \u0111\u00fang th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5031\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5031\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5031\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Ca-nhan-hoa-hashtag-thuong-hieu-\u2013-Tao-hashtag-doc-quyen-nhu-ShopCuaToi-hoac-TenBan.png\" alt=\"T\u1ea1o hashtag \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n nh\u01b0 #ShopCuaToi ho\u1eb7c #TenBan\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Ca-nhan-hoa-hashtag-thuong-hieu-\u2013-Tao-hashtag-doc-quyen-nhu-ShopCuaToi-hoac-TenBan.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Ca-nhan-hoa-hashtag-thuong-hieu-\u2013-Tao-hashtag-doc-quyen-nhu-ShopCuaToi-hoac-TenBan-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Ca-nhan-hoa-hashtag-thuong-hieu-\u2013-Tao-hashtag-doc-quyen-nhu-ShopCuaToi-hoac-TenBan-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Ca-nhan-hoa-hashtag-thuong-hieu-\u2013-Tao-hashtag-doc-quyen-nhu-ShopCuaToi-hoac-TenBan-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Ca-nhan-hoa-hashtag-thuong-hieu-\u2013-Tao-hashtag-doc-quyen-nhu-ShopCuaToi-hoac-TenBan-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5031\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">T\u1ea1o hashtag \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n nh\u01b0 #ShopCuaToi ho\u1eb7c #TenBan<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-ZOFPddPFFodxj7xG13NlSyUdgF1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Th\u00eam hashtag v\u00e0o ph\u1ea7n m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 video\u00a0<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T5uYdEITnoVPE1xP6i7l5z94goQ\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng hashtag tr\u00ean TikTok, \u0111i\u1ec1u quan tr\u1ecdng l\u00e0 ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u1eb7t \u0111\u00fang v\u1ecb tr\u00ed v\u00e0 s\u1ed1 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng h\u1ee3p l\u00fd \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea1t hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u. Kh\u00f4ng n\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7t hashtag trong ph\u1ea7n b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn, v\u00ec TikTok ch\u1ec9 \u01b0u ti\u00ean qu\u00e9t n\u1ed9i dung c\u00f3 trong ph\u1ea7n caption ch\u00ednh khi quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i video \u0111\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NcMmdWADwohyX9x9btXlOoqfgKh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo c\u00e1c chuy\u00ean gia n\u1ed9i dung TikTok, caption t\u1ed1i \u01b0u n\u00ean d\u00e0i kho\u1ea3ng 150\u2013300 k\u00fd t\u1ef1, bao g\u1ed3m c\u1ea3 ph\u1ea7n m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 v\u00e0 c\u00e1c hashtag. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n ch\u00e8n qu\u00e1 nhi\u1ec1u hashtag (tr\u00ean 7 hashtag), video c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 b\u1ecb \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 l\u00e0 spam, l\u00e0m gi\u1ea3m kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NAOjdZNrqoTDbCxqWtNlxlDTgHg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">M\u1ed9t v\u00e0i m\u1eb9o nh\u1ecf c\u1ea7n ghi nh\u1edb l\u00e0 b\u1ea1n h\u00e3y \u0111\u1eb7t hashtag quan tr\u1ecdng nh\u1ea5t \u1edf \u0111\u1ea7u caption, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng hashtag c\u00f3 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng d\u1eabn traffic cao nh\u01b0 hashtag trend ho\u1eb7c hashtag l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c. Beenn c\u1ea1nh \u0111\u00f3 h\u00e3y s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng kho\u1ea3ng tr\u1eafng ho\u1eb7c d\u1ea5u g\u1ea1ch (\u2013, \/) \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00e1ch bi\u1ec7t t\u1eebng hashtag, gi\u00fap caption d\u1ec5 nh\u00ecn, d\u1ec5 \u0111\u1ecdc v\u00e0 tr\u00e1nh g\u00e2y r\u1ed1i m\u1eaft cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5037\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5037\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5037\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Them-hashtag-vao-phan-mo-ta-video.png\" alt=\"\u01afu ti\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7t trong caption \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng qu\u00e9t\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Them-hashtag-vao-phan-mo-ta-video.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Them-hashtag-vao-phan-mo-ta-video-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Them-hashtag-vao-phan-mo-ta-video-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Them-hashtag-vao-phan-mo-ta-video-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Them-hashtag-vao-phan-mo-ta-video-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5037\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">\u01afu ti\u00ean \u0111\u1eb7t trong caption \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng qu\u00e9t<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-HD4Vdw5uloAjG2x69C5lBqSDgDc\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>\u0110a d\u1ea1ng h\u00f3a hashtag<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EmiWdM9rUoSkVKx7imilZRLUgtf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Tab \u201cKh\u00e1m ph\u00e1\u201d (Discover) tr\u00ean TikTok l\u00e0 ngu\u1ed3n ch\u00ednh th\u1ed1ng gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt nhanh c\u00e1c hashtag \u0111ang th\u1ecbnh h\u00e0nh theo t\u1eebng ng\u00e0y v\u00e0 t\u1eebng qu\u1ed1c gia. T\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e2y, TikTok hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb c\u00e1c hashtag n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng quan t\u00e2m, xu h\u01b0\u1edbng n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n \u0111ang di\u1ec5n ra.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JzTYdk7kkow65OxllLqlUWa6gmd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ngo\u00e0i ra, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00e2n t\u00edch s\u00e2u h\u01a1n v\u1ec1 hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t hashtag nh\u01b0:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OIz7d9UWIoeCk0xZJCflz5eLg3e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>TrendTok Analytics (ch\u1ea1y tr\u00ean iOS): cung c\u1ea5p d\u1eef li\u1ec7u th\u1eddi gian th\u1ef1c v\u1ec1 xu h\u01b0\u1edbng v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t hashtag theo ng\u00e0nh.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SiMOdLwDAodzY6xFWXcl4iFSgzh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Exolyt, TikBuddy, Hashtagify: ph\u00e2n t\u00edch m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn, t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng v\u00e0 h\u00e0nh vi t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi t\u1eebng hashtag.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5032\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5032\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5032\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Da-dang-hoa-hashtag-\u2013-Ket-hop-pho-bien-it-canh-tranh-va-chuyen-biet.png\" alt=\"K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn, \u00edt c\u1ea1nh tranh v\u00e0 chuy\u00ean bi\u1ec7t.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Da-dang-hoa-hashtag-\u2013-Ket-hop-pho-bien-it-canh-tranh-va-chuyen-biet.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Da-dang-hoa-hashtag-\u2013-Ket-hop-pho-bien-it-canh-tranh-va-chuyen-biet-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Da-dang-hoa-hashtag-\u2013-Ket-hop-pho-bien-it-canh-tranh-va-chuyen-biet-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Da-dang-hoa-hashtag-\u2013-Ket-hop-pho-bien-it-canh-tranh-va-chuyen-biet-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Da-dang-hoa-hashtag-\u2013-Ket-hop-pho-bien-it-canh-tranh-va-chuyen-biet-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5032\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">K\u1ebft h\u1ee3p ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn, \u00edt c\u1ea1nh tranh v\u00e0 chuy\u00ean bi\u1ec7t.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-GylldxCFUoXIB9xvi2RlVgH0g7b\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Theo d\u00f5i v\u00e0 c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt hashtag xu h\u01b0\u1edbng li\u00ean t\u1ee5c\u00a0<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B7fSdWaoCoZP1BxlfIRlTVlNgLe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Thay v\u00ec ch\u1ec9 t\u1eadp trung v\u00e0o nh\u1eefng hashtag ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn c\u00f3 m\u1ee9c \u0111\u1ed9 c\u1ea1nh tranh cao, b\u1ea1n n\u00ean \u0111a d\u1ea1ng h\u00f3a hashtag b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p linh ho\u1ea1t nhi\u1ec1u c\u1ea5p \u0111\u1ed9 kh\u00e1c nhau \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i. C\u1ee5 th\u1ec3, c\u00e1c hashtag ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn, c\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed9 c\u1ea1nh tranh cao gi\u00fap video ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn nh\u00f3m ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem \u0111\u1ea1i ch\u00fang v\u1edbi l\u01b0u l\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm l\u1edbn, nh\u01b0ng c\u0169ng d\u1ec5 b\u1ecb \u201cch\u00ecm\u201d n\u1ebfu n\u1ed9i dung kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ee7 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XRFXdNZv1o2vgsxhGl7lc3Kxg9f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Ng\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1ea1i, hashtag c\u1ee5 th\u1ec3, \u00edt c\u1ea1nh tranh l\u1ea1i cho ph\u00e9p video nh\u1eafm \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ebfn nh\u00f3m ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f3 m\u1ed1i quan t\u00e2m r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng, gi\u00fap t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng gi\u1eef ch\u00e2n ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o ra t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng h\u01a1n. B\u00ean c\u1ea1nh \u0111\u00f3, hashtag theo l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c gi\u00fap \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u1ecb n\u1ed9i dung m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch chuy\u00ean bi\u1ec7t, ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem trung th\u00e0nh quanh m\u1ed9t ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ec1 r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng. V\u00ec thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n TikTok ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng d\u1ef1a tr\u00ean vi\u1ec7c qu\u00e9t c\u1ee5m t\u1eeb kh\u00f3a li\u00ean quan, n\u00ean vi\u1ec7c k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i hashtag n\u00e0y s\u1ebd gi\u00fap m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng ph\u1ea1m vi ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn t\u1eeb nh\u00f3m ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem ph\u1ed5 th\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ebfn c\u00e1c nh\u00f3m ng\u00e1ch, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t v\u00e0 lan truy\u1ec1n t\u1ef1 nhi\u00ean m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_5039\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5039\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5039\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Theo-doi-va-cap-nhat-hashtag-xu-huong-lien-tuc-\u2013-Kiem-tra-muc-Kham-pha-moi-ngay.png\" alt=\"Ki\u1ec3m tra m\u1ee5c \u201cKh\u00e1m ph\u00e1\u201d m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Theo-doi-va-cap-nhat-hashtag-xu-huong-lien-tuc-\u2013-Kiem-tra-muc-Kham-pha-moi-ngay.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Theo-doi-va-cap-nhat-hashtag-xu-huong-lien-tuc-\u2013-Kiem-tra-muc-Kham-pha-moi-ngay-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Theo-doi-va-cap-nhat-hashtag-xu-huong-lien-tuc-\u2013-Kiem-tra-muc-Kham-pha-moi-ngay-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Theo-doi-va-cap-nhat-hashtag-xu-huong-lien-tuc-\u2013-Kiem-tra-muc-Kham-pha-moi-ngay-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Theo-doi-va-cap-nhat-hashtag-xu-huong-lien-tuc-\u2013-Kiem-tra-muc-Kham-pha-moi-ngay-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5039\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Ki\u1ec3m tra m\u1ee5c \u201cKh\u00e1m ph\u00e1\u201d m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-UOEVdADdpo6rgNxOL23liHMqg6e\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Ph\u00e2n t\u00edch hashtag c\u1ee7a \u0111\u1ed1i th\u1ee7\u00a0<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bvtud5Du2oAd0QxW7TclcjPsgWb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">M\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u vi\u1ec7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng hashtag tr\u00ean TikTok l\u00e0 ph\u00e2n t\u00edch c\u00e1c t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n l\u1edbn trong c\u00f9ng l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c. H\u00e3y ch\u1ecdn t\u1eeb 3\u20135 creator c\u00f3 l\u01b0\u1ee3ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c cao v\u00e0 theo d\u00f5i xem h\u1ecd th\u01b0\u1eddng s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng nh\u1eefng hashtag n\u00e0o trong c\u00e1c video viral, li\u1ec7u h\u1ecd c\u00f3 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng hashtag th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ri\u00eang hay kh\u00f4ng, v\u00e0 \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng hashtag n\u00e0o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u1eb7p l\u1ea1i nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ea7n trong c\u00e1c video g\u1ea7n nh\u1ea5t. Vi\u1ec7c quan s\u00e1t n\u00e0y gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n h\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1eeb th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf, nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n c\u00e1c xu h\u01b0\u1edbng hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng v\u00e0o n\u1ed9i dung c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh. Theo d\u1eef li\u1ec7u t\u1eeb TikTok Creator Center, c\u00e1c hashtag \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng l\u1eb7p l\u1ea1i trong 3\u20135 video g\u1ea7n nh\u1ea5t c\u1ee7a m\u1ed9t creator th\u01b0\u1eddng chi\u1ebfm h\u01a1n 60% n\u1ed9i dung viral c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd \u2014 \u0111i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y cho th\u1ea5y s\u1ef1 nh\u1ea5t qu\u00e1n trong c\u00e1ch d\u00f9ng hashtag ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u1ea7n quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i v\u00e0 lan truy\u1ec1n video.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BONjdk0FSoRTl4xpdBylIp9UgRd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_5035\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-5035\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-5035\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Phan-tich-hashtag-cua-doi-thu.png\" alt=\"Tham kh\u1ea3o hashtag c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c TikToker n\u1ed5i \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Phan-tich-hashtag-cua-doi-thu.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Phan-tich-hashtag-cua-doi-thu-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Phan-tich-hashtag-cua-doi-thu-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Phan-tich-hashtag-cua-doi-thu-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/08\/Phan-tich-hashtag-cua-doi-thu-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-5035\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Tham kh\u1ea3o hashtag c\u1ee7a c\u00e1c TikToker n\u1ed5i \u0111\u1ec3 h\u1ecdc h\u1ecfi.<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-L0D9dKeQLo7xQnxAcWGlWQ1Pgag\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>3. T\u1ed5ng h\u1ee3p nh\u1eefng hashtag TikTok nhi\u1ec1u view &amp; \u0111ang trend<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QWUadAwruow0WvxwlpHlhw6AgEh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hashtag kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00e2n lo\u1ea1i n\u1ed9i dung m\u00e0 c\u00f2n \u0111\u00f3ng vai tr\u00f2 chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c trong vi\u1ec7c gi\u00fap video ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng, t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb v\u00e0 kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng viral tr\u00ean TikTok. Vi\u1ec7c s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng hashtag m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch linh ho\u1ea1t, \u0111\u00fang m\u1ee5c \u0111\u00edch v\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi n\u1ed9i dung s\u1ebd gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n t\u1ed1i \u01b0u thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n, x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c doanh nghi\u1ec7p m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 v\u00e0 b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng. H\u00e3y ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng theo d\u00f5i xu h\u01b0\u1edbng, ph\u00e2n t\u00edch \u0111\u1ed1i th\u1ee7 v\u00e0 li\u00ean t\u1ee5c th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00ecm ra c\u00f4ng th\u1ee9c hashtag ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p nh\u1ea5t cho k\u00eanh c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-NpZSdi39woWWUwxTzoslEFs9gre\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"sheet\">\u0110ang t\u1ea3i Sheets. Vui l\u00f2ng th\u1eed l\u1ea1i sau khi ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t.<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"sheet\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"sheet\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Hs4ld1bTno09E0xayiZlQPcNgvb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HXjcdxwmZoWKXWx2UonlRnRagXf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DbKTdkhWYoO6U4xrDw5lJAneg7d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G1uLdZxz9o0PTAxKBZRllhjTgUd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O9KWdu2pTo6MwFxvXFgltbDcgse\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B0WcdXMVaocQq6xInUDlXkDrgNc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>B\u1ea1n \u0111ang t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm c\u00e1c hashtag \u0111ang trend, viral v\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh? Hashtag TikTok l\u00e0 ch\u00eca kh\u00f3a gi\u00fap video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i \u0111\u00fang t\u1ec7p ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem, gia t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb v\u00e0 d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng l\u00ean xu h\u01b0\u1edbng. D\u00f9 b\u1ea1n l\u00e0 ng\u01b0\u1eddi s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung hay kinh doanh [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":5047,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[29,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4984","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-tiktok","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4984","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/5"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4984"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4984\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":5217,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4984\/revisions\/5217"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/5047"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4984"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=4984"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=4984"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}